          "level": 2,
          "content": "二、选择题:（20题，每题1分，共20分。在A、B、C、D中选择一个正确答案。）"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.102,
            0.103,
            0.322,
            0.119
          ],
          "content": "31. 胆固醇合成的限速酶为:"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.136,
            0.124,
            0.307,
            0.139
          ],
          "content": "A. HMG CoA 裂解酶"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.494,
            0.125,
            0.673,
            0.14
          ],
          "content": "B. 琥珀酰 CoA 转硫酶"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.137,
            0.145,
            0.305,
            0.159
          ],
          "content": "C. HMG CoA 还原酶"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.494,
            0.146,
            0.661,
            0.16
          ],
          "content": "D. HMG CoA 合成酶"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.102,
            0.164,
            0.518,
            0.18
          ],
          "content": "32. 下列关于嘧啶核苷酸合成的叙述哪一项是正确的？"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.136,
            0.185,
            0.451,
            0.2
          ],
          "content": "A. 游离的氨是氨甲酰磷酸合成酶的底物"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.491,
            0.186,
            0.802,
            0.201
          ],
          "content": "B. 利用线粒体中的氨基甲酰磷酸合成酶"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.137,
            0.206,
            0.38,
            0.221
          ],
          "content": "C. 二氢乳清酸脱氢酶是限速酶"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.49,
            0.207,
            0.767,
            0.222
          ],
          "content": "D. 嘧啶环中的一个碳原子来自  $CO_{2}$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.102,
            0.226,
            0.584,
            0.242
          ],
          "content": "33. 在下列酶催化的反应中，需要辅酶或辅基种类最多的酶是:"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.139,
            0.246,
            0.341,
            0.261
          ],
          "content": "A. NADH 脱氢酶复合物;"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.492,
            0.247,
            0.733,
            0.262
          ],
          "content": "B.琥珀酸-CoQ还原酶复合物；"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.14,
            0.267,
            0.371,
            0.282
          ],
          "content": "C.α-酮戊二酸脱氢酶复合物；"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.488,
            0.268,
            0.634,
            0.282
          ],
          "content": "D.丙酮酸羧化酶。"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.102,
            0.287,
            0.398,
            0.302
          ],
          "content": "34. 乙酰 CoA 在不同组织中均可生成:"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.136,
            0.307,
            0.306,
            0.323
          ],
          "content": "A.  $CO_{2}$ 、 $H_{2}O$  和能量"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.486,
            0.309,
            0.571,
            0.323
          ],
          "content": "B. 脂肪酸"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.137,
            0.328,
            0.205,
            0.342
          ],
          "content": "C. 酮体"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.489,
            0.329,
            0.574,
            0.343
          ],
          "content": "D. 胆固醇"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.102,
            0.348,
            0.639,
            0.364
          ],
          "content": "35. 使用谷氨酰胺的类似物作抗代谢物，能阻断核酸代谢的哪个环节？"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.136,
            0.369,
            0.253,
            0.383
          ],
          "content": "A. UTP→CTP"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.485,
            0.37,
            0.61,
            0.384
          ],
          "content": "B. XMP→GMP"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.137,
            0.39,
            0.261,
            0.403
          ],
          "content": "C. UMP→CMP"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.485,
            0.39,
            0.617,
            0.404
          ],
          "content": "D. UMP→dTMP"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.102,
            0.409,
            0.408,
            0.424
          ],
          "content": "36. 长期饥饿时大脑的能量来源主要是:"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.136,
            0.429,
            0.222,
            0.445
          ],
          "content": "A. 葡萄糖"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.489,
            0.431,
            0.574,
            0.445
          ],
          "content": "B. 氨基酸"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.137,
            0.45,
            0.204,
            0.464
          ],
          "content": "C. 甘油"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.489,
            0.451,
            0.557,
            0.465
          ],
          "content": "D. 酮体"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.102,
            0.47,
            0.443,
            0.486
          ],
          "content": "37. 下列那种物质的合成过程仅在肝脏进行:"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.136,
            0.491,
            0.205,
            0.505
          ],
          "content": "A. 尿素"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.49,
            0.491,
            0.556,
            0.506
          ],
          "content": "B. 糖原"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.137,
            0.511,
            0.221,
            0.526
          ],
          "content": "C. 胆固醇"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.489,
            0.512,
            0.574,
            0.526
          ],
          "content": "D. 脂肪酸"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.102,
            0.531,
            0.517,
            0.547
          ],
          "content": "38. 下列哪个化合物不是脂肪酸 $\\beta$ 氧化所需的辅因子？"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.136,
            0.552,
            0.223,
            0.567
          ],
          "content": "A. 肉毒碱"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.489,
            0.553,
            0.566,
            0.566
          ],
          "content": "B.  $NAD^{+}$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.137,
            0.573,
            0.223,
            0.587
          ],
          "content": "C. NADP $^{+}$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.488,
            0.574,
            0.554,
            0.586
          ],
          "content": "D. FAD"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.102,
            0.592,
            0.512,
            0.608
          ],
          "content": "39. 柠檬酸循环被认为是一个需氧代谢途径，是因为:"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.136,
            0.612,
            0.415,
            0.628
          ],
          "content": "A. 循环的某些反应是以氧作为底物"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.49,
            0.614,
            0.712,
            0.629
          ],
          "content": "B. $\\mathrm{CO}_{2}$ 是该循环的一个产物"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.137,
            0.634,
            0.256,
            0.648
          ],
          "content": "C. 产生了 $\\mathrm{H}_2\\mathrm{O}$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.489,
            0.634,
            0.819,
            0.649
          ],
          "content": "D. 还原型的因子需通过电子传递链被氧化"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.102,
            0.653,
            0.495,
            0.669
          ],
          "content": "40. 乳酸脱氢酶在无氧酵解中尤为重要，这是因为:"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.136,
            0.674,
            0.469,
            0.689
          ],
          "content": "A. 产生 NADH，通过氧化磷酸化可以产能"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.492,
            0.675,
            0.699,
            0.689
          ],
          "content": "B. 产生电子传递链所需氧"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.137,
            0.695,
            0.343,
            0.709
          ],
          "content": "C. 为三羧酸循环提供乳酸"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.489,
            0.695,
            0.781,
            0.71
          ],
          "content": "D. 为3-磷酸甘油醛脱氢酶再生 $\\mathrm{NAD}^{+}$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.102,
            0.715,
            0.448,
            0.73
          ],
          "content": "41. 原核细胞中新生肽链的 N-末端氨基酸是:"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.136,
            0.735,
            0.24,
            0.75
          ],
          "content": "A. 甲硫氨酸"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.49,
            0.736,
            0.574,
            0.75
          ],
          "content": "B. 蛋氨酸"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.137,
            0.756,
            0.273,
            0.77
          ],
          "content": "C. 甲酰甲硫氨酸"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.489,
            0.756,
            0.609,
            0.771
          ],
          "content": "D. 任何氨基酸"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.102,
            0.776,
            0.482,
            0.791
          ],
          "content": "42. 在脂肪细胞中,用于酯化脂肪酸的甘油来源是:"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.136,
            0.796,
            0.361,
            0.812
          ],
          "content": "A. 大部分从葡萄糖衍生而来"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.489,
            0.797,
            0.853,
            0.812
          ],
          "content": "B. 主要从甘油激酶催化甘油的磷酸化作用而来"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.137,
            0.817,
            0.343,
            0.832
          ],
          "content": "C. 由葡萄糖异生作用产生"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.489,
            0.817,
            0.643,
            0.832
          ],
          "content": "D. 以上说法都不对"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.102,
            0.837,
            0.591,
            0.852
          ],
          "content": "43. 下列关于从乙酰 CoA 合成脂肪酸的叙述中，哪个是正确的？"
        },
        {
