          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.482,
            0.38,
            0.604,
            0.395
          ],
          "content": "B. GTP 的水解"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.145,
            0.4,
            0.285,
            0.415
          ],
          "content": "C. CAMP 的水解"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.482,
            0.4,
            0.655,
            0.416
          ],
          "content": "D. 烟酰胺核苷酸参与"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.102,
            0.42,
            0.444,
            0.436
          ],
          "content": "48. 原核生物基因转终止子在终止点前均有:"
